    "[Fate's Holding, Barrow Summit]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "Providing a view of the spiraled pathway that encircles the barrow, a hillock top has a steep trail leading down its side to the distant gates of the neighborhood.  Clanking chimes decorate the tops of crooked sticks that rest within short barrier walls that connect shallow cairns to one another across the flat plain.  Disappearing into darkness, a spindled copper-bound ladder offers access to the interior of the barrow where the faint flicker of torchlight is visible."
